time Link

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer
box block [link: https://github.com/cardene777/dragon]

step Ask
  say link on a box makes the box a link to that place in the drawn diagram.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0

step Next
  say When another diagram draws what is inside the box, link to its page.
  proposer -> block [at: 1]
  now -> 1
